"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23354"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95817"},"originalCharacterName":"篠原 小唄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"509"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"72"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"143"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"78"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A petite-figured older sister who takes care of her younger siblings in place of her parents, who are busy taking care of their Izakaya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being the same age as the protagonist, she has acquired a maternal nature due to being an older sister. She doesn't have an inferiority complex because of her childish appearance, but she does think that she's not ready for love. She doesn't have much sexual knowledge, but she is very serious and studies hard once she starts dating the protagonist. She doesn't realize that she has a dormant desire to be pampered by someone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95817"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"家が居酒屋をやっていて繁盛し大忙し。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弟妹がたくさんいて、忙しい両親の代わりによく面倒を見ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年の離れた弟妹がいることもあり、「お姉ちゃん」を超えて「ママ」と言うべき母性を身に付け、人の世話をするのは当り前のことだと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の中に誰かに甘えたいという思いが眠っているのに気付いていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘えたいのは疲れているからではなく、今よりもっと安心したいから。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目ロリな自分に劣等感がある訳ではないが、こんな見た目では恋愛とは縁遠いだろうと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性知識は学校で教わった程度だったが、付き合うことになってから猛烈に勉強し、エロマンガで授乳手コキのことも知る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23354","sourceWorkId":"30627","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"家の居酒屋が繁盛して忙しい両親の代わりに、弟妹たち の面倒を見ている小さなお姉ちゃん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同級生だが、年の離れた弟妹がいることもあり 「ママ」と言うべき母性を身に付けている。見た目が幼い自分に劣等感は無いが、恋愛とは縁遠いだ ろうと思っている。性知識はあまりないが、付き合うことになってから猛烈に勉強する生真面目さを持つ。 自分の中に、誰かに甘えたいという思いが眠っているのに気付いていない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91400"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91400","value":"よしよし"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91400","value":"創作料理"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9dd112f457285e20ebd2ef99181dcaa2691cc5f43f6c16fb41b0fa279df5e959.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/617c28f3b7e8735280bc1498dc6ce0d3fae8f2f04336a99c66dd0ec28688a527.webp","width":84,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"さいとうよしえ","creatorId":"vndb:s1545","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1545","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1545","name":"さいとう よしえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:366851:91400:20696:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c95819","characterName":"夜舟 初穂","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"91402","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"328029"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23356"],"vndbCharacterId":"c95819"},"originalCharacterName":"夜舟 初穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"107"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"169"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her family is an old shrine family that has been enshrining a local deity for generations."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Usually, she runs a mysterious grocery store that her father had purchased on the grounds of the shrine, and when she's not at the store, she can be found in front of the station with a musical instrument in her hand, performing live on the streets."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is often called \"Onee-sama\" at her girls' school and often receives chocolates on Valentine's Day, but she feels that the girls who have feelings for her are only in love with romance and do not see the real her. While having the doubt of \"what is the real me?\", she is always seeking something to be the focal point of her life."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c95819"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は代々氏神を祀る旧社家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神社の境内には父親が仕入れた謎の雑貨を売る怪しい店があり、初穂が店を開けた時だけ開いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運良く開店している時間に訪れることができれば、その人が必要としているものが必ず手に入るというジンクスがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"店を開けていない時は楽器を手に駅前でストリートライブに興じている事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子校では「お姉様」と呼ばれバレンタインには同性からチョコもらいがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分に想いを寄せる少女たちは恋に恋しているだけで本当の自分を見てくれていないと感じるが、「本当の自分って？」という問いかけに、自身が答えを出すことができないでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため彼女はいつも、自分の軸になってくれる何かを探し求めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23356","sourceWorkId":"30627","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は代々氏神を祀る旧社家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は、神社の境内にある父親が仕入れたという謎の雑貨店を営んでいたり、店にいない時は楽器を手に駅前でストリートライブに興じている事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女子校では「お姉様」と呼ばれバレンタインにはチョコをよくもらうが、自分に想いを寄せる少女たちは恋に恋しているだけで本当の自分を見てくれていないと感じている。「本当の自分って？」と疑問を持ちながら、いつも自分の軸になってくれる何かを探し求めている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91402"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"特技","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91402","value":"ヴァイオリン"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"91402","value":"食べ歩き"}],"metadataCandid